                    briefing_title_r2:      `Round 2 — Design interventions per profile`,
                    briefing_text_r2:       `Now design a coherent intervention for each profile — and match it to the interface level you diagnosed. <em>Not</em> “more training for everyone.” Early-career are well-developed but burning out (a <strong>wellbeing</strong> and job-design problem). Mid-career are plateaued and caregiving-squeezed (an <strong>organisation &amp; life-stage</strong> problem — a path, not a course). Senior specialists face the <strong>employability paradox</strong>: visible investment in market-recognised skills, paired with meaningful internal roles, often <em>raises</em> retention. Balance employability and wellbeing deliberately — they reinforce, and sometimes trade off.`,
