                    briefing_text_r4:       `Mid-cycle results are mixed: mid-career mobility is cutting that group's turnover, but a senior reskilling program has low uptake. A complication lands — a competitor is <strong>poaching your newly-upskilled mid-career cohort</strong>. The reflex is to stop upskilling; the sustainable answer is to pair the raised employability with <em>meaningful internal roles</em> so staying is the better option. Fund what is improving sustainability, fix or cut what is not, institutionalise a <strong>standing sustainable-career system</strong>, and pitch all four KPIs to the board.`,

                    r1_mid_label:           `Mid-career staff are the most flight-prone (24% turnover). What is their breakage, really?`,
